## 🔄 The Continuous Pipeline (FAIRY DUST)

**FAIRY DUST** (*Fabrication, Autonomy, Integration, Robotics, Yield – Dust Utilization*) is the architectural integration that ensures every byproduct immediately becomes the raw input for the next manufacturing stage.

| Origin | Raw Byproduct | Processing Mechanism | End-Product |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Prufrock Excavation** | Regolith Tailings | Microwave / Laser Sintering | Monolithic Tunnel Walls & Radiation Shields |
| **Biological Life Support** | Exhaled CO2 | Sabatier Reactor | Methalox Rocket Propellant |
| **Biological Farming** | Fungal Mycelium | Biological Inoculation + Dust | Low-Power Bio-Composite Structural Blocks |
| **Mission / Debris Recapture** | Scrap Metal & Plastics | Shredder + 3D Printer / Smelter | Optimus Parts, Fasteners, Pipe Infrastructure |

